# From the private vault to the edge, and where each step runs.
direction: right

Mac [dashed] {
  Obsidian vault [icon: file, note: private]
  Content sync [icon: terminal, note: MDX · images]
}

GitHub [dashed] {
  Repository [icon: code, note: public snapshot]
  dist branch [icon: file, note: built site]
}

Cloudflare [dashed] {
  Pages build [icon: cpu, note: Astro · AVIF]
  Edge [icon: globe, anchor, note: CSP · Functions]
}

Obsidian vault > Content sync
Content sync > Repository: pull request
Repository > Pages build
Repository > dist branch
Pages build > Edge
